          "_name": "content4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"mbr-section content4\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"8\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"8\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#fffcfa\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>The day you've spent months planning will feel like a bit of a blur</b><div><br></div></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">Everyone says the same thing after their wedding:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">\"It went by so quickly.\"</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">One moment you're getting ready.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">The next you're on the dance floor wondering where the day went.</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">There will be hugs you never saw.</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">Tears you didn't notice.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">Friends laughing together while you were across the room.</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">That's why we make wedding videos!</span></div><div><br></div></h3>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center py-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-black-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
